          "id": "india-modi-bastar-naxal-2026-11-08",
          "headline": "Modi says no district in India is now hit by Naxalism, in Diwali visit to Bastar",
          "summary": "Prime Minister Narendra Modi spent Diwali with CRPF, CoBRA and other security forces at a camp in Karanpur, Bastar, in Chhattisgarh. He said that for the first time no district in the country is affected by Naxalism, and that no CRPF personnel died on duty in the past year.",
          "why_it_matters": "An end to the Maoist insurgency would open mineral-rich central India to more mining, roads and investment.",
