          "headline": "Iran's IRGC says tankers hit in Hormuz; US says it disabled a ship running its blockade",
          "summary": "Iran's Revolutionary Guards say three oil tankers using an 'unauthorised route' caught fire after explosions in the Strait of Hormuz, and the UAE says it rescued 22 sailors from a burning cargo ship. Separately, US Central Command says its aircraft struck the stern of a St Kitts-flagged ship in the Gulf of Oman late Saturday after the crew ignored warnings and tried to leave after visiting an Iranian port.",
